{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00636","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 宁和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 宁和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎驭失天纲，土德承天命。\n英猷被寰宇，懿躅隆邦政。\n七德已绥边，九夷咸底定。\n景化覃遐迩，深仁洽翔泳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}